      },
      "lineNbr": 6179,
      "author": {
        "id": 1181388
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-07T15:19:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you very much for pointing that out. I haven\u0027t thought about this scenario. I\u0027ve changed the VH implementation (pa/3389007) to call put_prev_task to remove the elevated task from runqueue and then call pick_next_task again to find another suitable task (if any) instead of returning NULL and scheduling the idle task.",
      "parentUuid": "f6e05b2e_b3bd41ea",
      "revId": "737fd41e4377248c201bf2507fcab542d2d718a7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
